Package: secretsR
Title: Credential Resolution for Studyflix R Applications
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Esta", "Kempf", , "esta.kempf@studyflix.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Resolves Studyflix credentials from Google Secret Manager, from
    legacy safer-encrypted files, or from environment variables, behind a single
    function. Replaces credential handling previously embedded in Billomatics.
